      },
      "text": "@SemiAnalysis_ @vllm_project @inferact 4x in under 20 days is ~7.2% a day compounding (4^(1/20) = 1.072)\n\nand the no atomics part matters more then ppl think: fp32 add isnt associative. (2^24 + 1) + 1 = 2^24 but 2^24 + (1 + 1) = 2^24 + 2, so atomic order can flip output bits run to run",
      "url": "https://x.com/ArunSiddardha/status/2122736279184081203"
    },
